\".\nУдаление: Любой бинд можно снести из списка кнопкой \"X\".\nСворачивание: Окно мешает? Жми на тире в шапке, оно свернется в тонкую полоску.\nВизуал: Скругленные углы и нормальные слои (окна не застревают друг под другом).\nКак юзать:\nИнжектишь через Delta или любой другой экзекутор.\nЖмешь \"+\", вводишь фразу, жмешь \"ОК\".\nПользуешься.","tags":["Universal","Simple","Script","Chat","Easy"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"696bcfa53593559f3689e278","username":"Hell_world","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b82266d21c42172ce00b19739bc8bdff0deab1c34b341fcaf492006d71ad7c18.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696bcfa53593559f3689e278-1771081200571.png"},"lvl":13,"status":"offline","id":"696bcfa53593559f3689e278","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":100000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b82266d21c42172ce00b19739bc8bdff0deab1c34b341fcaf492006d71ad7c18.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/696bcfa53593559f3689e278-1771081200571.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-21T02:34:57.833Z","last":"","win":14,"math":4},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"69a562f8853e4e6d5c4dd121","editBy":{"_id":"696bcfa53593559f3689e278","username":"Hell_world","status":"offline","id":"696bcfa53593559f3689e278"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-03-02T10:14:16.764Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"69a5671bd0b74da9a792b832","commentBy":{"_id":"64ca4bb3857e9fe72778647d","username":"Emil2006","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/10e88881431f0f0205b53d43ab8fd81462d636f8b5f5f4cc70f06cd90b5394b6.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/64ca4bb3857e9fe72778647d-1740484679806.png"},"createdAt":"2023-08-02T12:27:31.607Z","lastActive":"2026-08-03T18:54:52.103Z","statu